{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, move and pick-up obj. Check obj properties and perform task. Otherwise, scan or move randomly. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveTowardsObject    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ReturnObjectToOriginalLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = RandomMovement    />",
